From 4caef5f67aa430259216c8a40dbc82b136c7bb5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 08:00:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Pengo arcade driver ported from dsp-emulator

Port pengo_hw.pas into dsp-cpp with the supporting Namco WSG sound chip
and Sega Z80 opcode/data decryptor. The Z80 core now exposes an
opcode_fetch() flag so encrypted ROMs can serve different bytes for M1
fetches and data reads, matching nz80.pas.
